<title>FRANCE: BUT says Kingfisher rumour unfounded.</title>
<headline>BUT says Kingfisher rumour unfounded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French furniture and electrical equipment retailer BUT said a report in the Financial Times that Britain's Kingfisher Plc was proposing a takeover was unfounded.</p>
<p>&quot;The article is without foundation,&quot; a BUT spokeswoman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
